    "answer": "Based on T20 ball-by-ball data in the corpus (restricted to venues with at least 600 legal balls bowled, to avoid tiny-sample noise), the venue with the highest average runs per over is:\n\n**National Sports Academy, Sofia** \u2014 **9.617 runs per over**\n\n- Total balls bowled (all deliveries, including wides/no-balls): **5,065**\n- Legal balls bowled (excluding wides/no-balls, the standard basis for \"overs\"): **4,668**\n- Total runs scored there: **7,482**\n\nFor reference, the next-highest venues were Barsapara Cricket Stadium (9.374 runs/over) and The Cooper Associates County Ground (9.287 runs/over).\n\nNote: this is a straightforward historical record from the data (not a prediction or an adjusted/ability-based figure), and it's sensitive to sample size \u2014 Sofia's total of ~845 overs is much smaller than some of the other venues in the list, so treat it as a descriptive stat about matches actually played there rather than a robust \"scoring venue\" ranking.",
